name: sim.setScriptAttribute
description:
luaSynopsis: sim.setScriptAttribute(int scriptHandle,int attributeID,number/bool attribute)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. scriptHandle: handle of a script
2. attributeID: the script attributeID
3. floatVal: the floating point attribute (if applicable)
4. intOrBoolVal: the integer or bool attribute (if applicable)
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
replacedBy:
- name: autoYieldDelay, class: detachedScript, file: detachedScript_autoYieldDelay.property
- name: code, class: detachedScript, file: detachedScript_code.property
- name: enabled, class: detachedScript, file: detachedScript_enabled.property
- name: execPriority, class: detachedScript, file: detachedScript_execPriority.property
- name: language, class: detachedScript, file: detachedScript_language.property
- name: restartOnError, class: detachedScript, file: detachedScript_restartOnError.property
- name: scriptName, class: detachedScript, file: detachedScript_scriptName.property
- name: addOnPath, class: detachedScript, file: detachedScript_addOnPath.property
- name: addOnMenuPath, class: detachedScript, file: detachedScript_addOnMenuPath.property
